Gwyddion 2 sfunctions helpers
=============================

This repository provides helper utilities and UI widgets for running Gwyddion's
`sfunctions` module from Python.  It exposes GTK+ controls that match the
statistics tab options, including generation of 2D PSDF images with a selectable
zoom factor and Angular Spectrum outputs.

Package contents
----------------

* ``SFunctionsOptions`` – container capturing the user's processing choices.
* ``SFunctionsOptionsPane`` – GTK widget presenting the available toggles and
  zoom factor spinner.
* ``process_containers`` – convenience routine that applies the selected
  processing to one or more ``gwy.GwyContainer`` instances.
* ``run_psdf_image`` / ``run_psdf2d`` – helpers that trigger the ``sfunctions``
  module for the respective outputs.
* ``run_angular_spectrum`` – helper that configures and runs the Angular
  Spectrum calculation and returns the resulting ``gwy.GwyDataLine``.

The helpers rely on the ``gwy`` bindings being available in the runtime
environment alongside GTK+ 3.
